<description>&lt;p&gt;Recent bomb attacks in Damascus suburbs have killed two people, including a child, and an explosion near the capital killed a father and his child. A separate car bomb near the capital killed two individuals, one of whom was a child, and another car bomb in a Damascus suburb killed a father and his daughter. These incidents show continued lethal violence targeting civilians in and around Damascus. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c3rrg9xgqlwpo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261115-three-sentenced-to-death-over-jordan-church-attack&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/15/jordan-sentences-three-men-to-death-by-hanging-after-deadly-church-attack?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
